      <ReportItem port="443" svc_name="www" protocol="tcp" severity="4" pluginID="157404" pluginName="Microsoft Exchange Server CVE-2022-41040, CVE-2022-41082 (ProxyNotShell)" pluginFamily="Windows">
        <synopsis>The remote Exchange server is missing security updates.</synopsis>
        <description>The Microsoft Exchange Server installation is missing the September 2022 Security Update. It is therefore vulnerable to ProxyNotShell, a chain of an SSRF (CVE-2022-41040) and an RCE (CVE-2022-41082).</description>
        <solution>Apply the September 2022 Microsoft Exchange Server security update.</solution>
        <risk_factor>Critical</risk_factor>
        <plugin_output>Build : 15.01.2375.024 (vulnerable, requires SU09-2022 or later).</plugin_output>
